content:
Help me define bounded contexts. Below I will provide domain information. 

#### Data:
These are the extracted objects and the subdomain grouping:
```json
{
  "subdomains": {
    "Camping": {
      "objects": [
        "Camp",
        "Activity",
        "Staff",
        "Camp Rules",
        "Camp Facility",
        "Camp Schedule",
        "Camper Group",
        "Camp Worker"
      ]
    },
    "Enrollment": {
      "objects": [
        "Enrollment",
        "Parent",
        "Camper Records",
        "Emergency Information",
        "Medical Information",
        "Camper"
      ]
    },
    "Parenting": {
      "objects": [
        "Parent",
        "Camper",
        "Schedule",
        "Counselor",
        "Parent Feedback"
      ]
    },
    "Administration": {
      "objects": [
        "Camp Administrator",
        "Parent Feedback",
        "Camper Records",
        "Emergency Information",
        "Medical Information",
        "Camp Worker",
        "Report"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Camp Administrator",
      "description": "Manages camp operations, enrollments, staff, and communication with parents"
    },
    {
      "name": "Enrollment",
      "description": "Record of a camper’s registration and participation in the camp"
    },
    {
      "name": "Camper",
      "description": "Child or participant attending the camp, linked to parents and activities",
      "attributes": [
        "Camper Records"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Camper Records",
      "description": "All administrative and personal data about a camper",
      "attributes": [
        "Emergency Information",
        "Medical Information"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Emergency Information",
      "description": "Details for quick response in case of emergencies"
    },
    {
      "name": "Medical Information",
      "description": "Health-related data and medical needs of a camper"
    },
    {
      "name": "Camp Schedule",
      "description": "Overview of organized events taking place at the camp"
    },
    {
      "name": "Parent",
      "description": "Registers and manages their child’s participation and communication with the camp"
    },
    {
      "name": "Camp",
      "description": "The main entity representing the summer camp and its internal structure",
      "attributes": [
        "Activity",
        "Staff",
        "Camp Rules",
        "Camp Facility",
        "Camp Schedule"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Activity",
      "description": "Planned events, lessons, or games scheduled for campers"
    },
    {
      "name": "Staff",
      "description": "All people employed at the camp including counselors and workers"
    },
    {
      "name": "Camp Rules",
      "description": "Guidelines defining expected behavior for campers and staff"
    },
    {
      "name": "Camp Facility",
      "description": "Physical locations and resources used for camp activities"
    },
    {
      "name": "Camper Group",
      "description": "Organized group of campers for easier supervision and activity planning"
    },
    {
      "name": "Parent Feedback",
      "description": "Comments or suggestions parents give to improve camp services"
    },
    {
      "name": "Schedule",
      "description": "Planned timetable of activities and events for campers"
    },
    {
      "name": "Counselor",
      "description": "Staff member directly supervising and guiding campers"
    },
    {
      "name": "Camp Worker",
      "description": "Handles camp operations, maintenance, and logistics"
    },
    {
      "name": "Report",
      "description": "Notes or alerts raised by camp staff about incidents, supplies, or behavior"
    }
  ]
}
```

#### Task:
- Assign the subdomains to bounded contexts. 
- Name the subdomain the bounded context might be derived from, it might also be multiple.
- Identify cases, where an object does not have a unified meaning across all bounded contexts and suggest a name change.
- Return the bounded contexts in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "... -> ..."
      ]
    }
  }
}
```
